@@ -0,0 +1,390 @@
+/*
+
+    Quick and Dirty Game Development Framework (QDGDF)
+
+    Angel Ortega <angel@triptico.com> et al.
+
+    This software is released into the public domain.
+    NO WARRANTY. See file LICENSE for details.
+
